 href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1V1i8jPsakP3p0rMKynRGWq-eogg0ceGh/view?usp=sharing\">Prosedur operasional standar peminjaman fasilitas dan ruangan</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1u8hoBCiOlkb8ZiOgVkQj5c_Uqgfkk43B/view?usp=sharing\">Prosedur operasional standar pendaftaran asisten praktikum</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xHUtPNq2BjAtDB3krOE6He_leaypnpcW/view?usp=sharing\">Prosedur operasional standar ijin lembur di laboratorium</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x9iYN2PKoq-0g9C7j7CQcRyFuKnGnh7s/view?usp=sharing\">Prosedur operasional standar kunjungan ke laboratorium</a></li><li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pFd-8q37lXliKv9Jo0mT_ElHhRjfH-fQ/view?usp=sharing\">Prosedur operasional standar pelaksanaan praktikum di laboratorium</a></li></ul><p><strong>2. Hasil Penelitian</strong></p><ul><li>Perancangan Alat Bantu Diagnosis Tumor Otak Menggunakan ResNet101V2</li><li>Pengolahan Sampah Domestik Hybrid Menjadi Refuse Derive Fuel</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"}],"isInner":""}],"isInner":""}]}